    "transcript": [
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Hey.\" Lucas settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"I’m listening.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"What are you hoping for? Not the big stuff. The small thing.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"A full night's sleep. Just one. Where I don't wake up listening.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"God, yes. That's the dream now. Eight hours of not being afraid.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "Their voice loosens. The guardedness thins."
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Here's the thing: A full night's sleep. Not safety, not answers — just eight hours where nothing needs me. That's my whole theology now.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Still on what you're hoping for.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"As I said — we're still on what you're hoping for.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"What did you do for fun? Before. The thing you'd do on a perfect Saturday.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Nothing fancy. Just — people. Being around my people.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"The free things. Turns out they were the expensive ones.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I was a police officer — fun was whatever I could steal between shifts. Now fun is watching the fire and not being afraid. It's a downgrade and an upgrade.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Anyway — I should get back to it. Good talking, though.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
     }
    ],
