   {
    "vid": "lucas_brown",
    "tag": "D-talk-request",
    "turns": 10,
    "naturalEnd": true,
    "forcedClose": false,
    "transcript": [
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"About that question — What's something from your old life that's actually useful here? Makes sense to me.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Patience. Sounds dumb. But waiting — really waiting, without fidgeting — that's a superpower now.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "A small chill settles between you. They're choosing words more carefully."
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Being a police officer taught me to read people fast — who's lying, who's scared, who needs a job. Turns out that's a survival skill. Who knew.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"When's the last time you really laughed?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Recently — someone tripped over nothing and we all lost it. It felt like stealing.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Stealing joy. I like that. We should steal more of it.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Three days ago. Someone dropped a whole basket of tubers and we just stood there laughing. It wasn't even funny. It was the standing there. Simple as that.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on your useful old-life skills.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Keep going.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I've got things to see to. Don't be a stranger.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"...\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "You don't answer. The quiet turns pointed."
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "They nod, already turning away."
     }
    ],
