     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"And?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"There's a laugh I keep hearing in my head — not anyone here, just from before. Sometimes I borrow it. I'll be hauling water and laugh at nothing, and for a second it's like the old world left the door open a crack.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
