      "text": "\"Still on the funniest thing you've seen. Anyway — how are YOU doing?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Honestly? Not great.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Thank you for saying it straight. Most people perform.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"And?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "They relax, a fraction. This is going well."
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Can I just — the funniest thing you've seen — that's still where we are.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"Wait — what were we talking about?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Like I said — we're still on the funniest thing you've seen.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"And?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"I could talk all day, but — go on. We'll talk more.\""
     },
     {
      "who": "YOU",
      "text": "\"...\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "They fill the quiet. \"Anyway — where was I?\""
     },
     {
      "who": "NPC",
      "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
